Data Licensing & Provenance Notice

- Code and original analysis: Petr Salomoun's permissive attribution license (above).
- Underlying exam data: CERMAT / Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports (MŠMT),
  subject to Czech public sector open data terms.

The raw entrance exam (JPZ) and Maturita graduation exam (MZ) datasets are official
public open data published by CERMAT (Centrum pro zjišťování výsledků vzdělávání)
and MŠMT. No ownership is claimed over the underlying public datasets. Users of the
raw data should comply with CERMAT/MŠMT open data terms and citation guidelines.
See DATA_LICENSE.md for detailed data provenance and attribution guidance.
